Filter lists
------------
blockads-linux does not redistribute any filter list. Lists are downloaded at
runtime, on the user's machine, directly from their original publishers
(AdGuard, EasyList, StevenBlack, HaGeZi, abuse.ch URLhaus, malware-filter,
Dandelion Sprout, uBlock Origin, and others). Each list is subject to its own
licence; see the About page of the application for per-list attribution.
